# Deploy workflow

After finishing any code change in this project:

1. Commit with a clear message (why, not only what).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (usually `main`).
3. Do this without waiting to be asked — Cloudflare Pages deploys from the push.

Do not amend unless the usual amend safety rules allow it. Do not force-push.
